{"id": "EUVD-2026-103006", "enisaUuid": "4e4c97d3-fa19-3572-b5b3-2a8cb41f9d1a", "description": "tarteaucitron.js before 1.37.0 contains a regular expression denial of service vulnerability that allows attackers to block visitor pages by supplying unescaped cookie names to cookie.purge. Attackers can plant a cookie from a sibling subdomain or inject a purgeBtn element with a catastrophic-backtracking data-cookie pattern that freezes the page when the purge button is clicked.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:40:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:23:25", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/commit/60faaba5fd541cad770549d422fc4ac7de657e56", "https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/releases/tag/v1.37.0", "https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/blob/v1.36.0/tarteaucitron.js#L2169-L2175", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/tarteaucitron-js-before-1.37.0-redos-via-unescaped-cookie-name-in-cookie-purge"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h33v-xq5w-v2mw", "CVE-2026-111714"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5ccb78b7-bafd-3249-987e-b55624614a51", "product": {"name": "tarteaucitron.js", "vendor": {"name": "amauric"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.37.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fd693a2f-23fe-3eed-9a0d-a3e34bf88b7f", "vendor": {"name": "amauric"}}], "isExploited": false}